        "titleMain": "Toxic positivity",
        "titleItalic": "hurts",
        "body": "Pushing pain aside with 'good vibes only' invalidates your experience and deepens shame. Real healing starts with honest acceptance.",
        "handle": "@mayabennett"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-pastel-soft",
      "slots": {
        "authorName": "Maya Bennett",
        "pageOf": "3 / 8",
        "number": "2",
        "numberLabel": "Practice",
        "titleMain": "Validate your",
        "titleItalic": "feelings",
        "body": "Instead of numbing sadness, name it gently. Saying 'this is hard' gives your emotions the space they need to soften naturally.",
        "handle": "@mayabennett"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-pastel-soft",
      "slots": {
        "authorName": "Maya Bennett",
        "pageOf": "4 / 8",
        "number": "3",
        "numberLabel": "Practice",
        "titleMain": "Talk like a",
        "titleItalic": "friend",
        "body": "Would you shame a loved one for struggling? Offer yourself the same kindness. Your inner voice deserves compassion, not criticism.",
        "handle": "@mayabennett"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-pastel-soft",
      "slots": {
        "authorName": "Maya Bennett",
        "pageOf": "5 / 8",
        "number": "4",
        "numberLabel": "Practice",
        "titleMain": "Rest without",
        "titleItalic": "guilt",
        "body": "Productivity is not a measure of worth. Giving yourself permission to pause is a radical act of self-compassion and care.",
        "handle": "@mayabennett"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-pastel-soft",
      "slots": {
        "authorName": "Maya Bennett",
        "pageOf": "6 / 8",
        "number": "5",
        "numberLabel": "Practice",
        "titleMain": "Embrace being",
        "titleItalic": "human",
        "body": "Perfection is an impossible standard. Allowing yourself to make mistakes reduces anxiety and builds resilience through every messy moment.",
        "handle": "@mayabennett"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-pastel-soft",
      "slots": {
